        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Blegh! Stinks like hell! Did those fowlbeasts come back again?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's having an effect! The herd is changing direction!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "text": "What did you use, Artisan?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_751_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fowlbeast, stinky! Made Dung Bomb!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Artisan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, so that was it! Of course my little Smithy would be able to craft a Dung Bomb from droppings so quickly!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you throw a Dung Bomb onto a monster, they won't be able to stand the smell and will run away from mew, just like us with Noir Corne earlier.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, no using me as an example!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even though they changed directions, they're still rampaging through the forest. This will be troublesome if the Rathalos tracks get trampled over.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rampaging hornbeasts... I feel like that's definitely out of the ordinary. Why would they go berserk for no reason?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It doesn't matter, we just need to stop them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "With my expurrtise, I postulate that there must be a lead hornbeast at the front to make such a huge herd move like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Really now? If that's the case, then we'll just have to cut it down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, what do you mean by 'just have to cut it down'?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What part of that was hard to understand?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And how exactly do you plan to do that, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just charge right in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's so many of them and they're all in a frenzy... You sure about that? We don't even know why they're going crazy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And will they wait for us to sit down and figure out the cause? Cover me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait up! Arty, do you still have that, uh... Dung Bomb?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_751_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_nekohappy01"
    },
    {
        "text": "So much stinky! Fur mew!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Artisan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Scholar, I just want to make sure... If I can land this on the lead hornbeast, is it possible the rest of them will disperse?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Based to their purr-evious reaction... In theory.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But pawbably not fur long! And you have to aim from up close to make sure it hits the right one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aight, I think I got something. I'll try and aim for it from up here on the tree.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yato, when the other hornbeasts scatter, take the chance and subdue the leader in one strike!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course I will.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But this means you'll...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Get even stinkier? Eh, couldn't be any worse\u2014yuck!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
