    {
        "text": "Today's sun is setting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look...The light between the leaves wavers, while their rustling in the darkness grows ever louder.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "A momentary impulse... O beasts who have gone astray.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "You will not return from the darkness of the forest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
